{"version":1,"content":"<p>俄羅斯與烏克蘭周五（23日）表示，在美國第一夫人梅拉尼婭斡旋下，雙方同意下周二（27日）在俄方控制的烏克蘭南部前線城鎮奧列什基（Oleshky）停火，讓救援物質經人道走廊運往區內，以及讓平民撤離。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T02:44:13.878506+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T02:29:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T01:18:41.370054+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T02:38:17.092426+00:00","content_hash":"3ebc3623e1673a054631830579d3061067f25cf15fd6f03b7e33ca9e5361b208","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}